WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Lighting design must account for what the driver can see and what others can see. A styling sketch alone cannot establish compliance.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Draw the lamp, target directions and nearby body occlusion; identify the test rule and jurisdiction separately.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Coverage diagram

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

